    {
      "id": "u_fe27ad2eecd462830295110f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "use __TRILIUM_PH_0__ (or __TRILIUM_PH_1__) to download latest __TRILIUM_PH_2__ (copy link from __TRILIUM_PH_3__release page__TRILIUM_PH_4__, notice __TRILIUM_PH_5__ suffix) on your server.",
      "sourceHash": "fe27ad2eecd462830295110ffde38ee28efbb8cb2c7be17263391b8992e84e83",
      "context": "Packaged version for Linux > Steps",
      "contextHash": "6bbbcdba61f98a6d7a1c96f9d8afb4ab0842c7c443cb4c50819185a5aec8d5df",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "サーバー上で __TRILIUM_PH_0__（または __TRILIUM_PH_1__）を使用して最新の __TRILIUM_PH_2__ をダウンロードします（__TRILIUM_PH_3__リリースページ__TRILIUM_PH_4__からリンクをコピーしてください。__TRILIUM_PH_5__の接尾辞に注意してください）。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5c10f32665d0e8f25bcb75b3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "unpack the archive, e.g. using __TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "5c10f32665d0e8f25bcb75b3ff1d7fa1bc0c444d27fe17aa56f09c1c01116d20",
      "context": "Packaged version for Linux > Steps",
      "contextHash": "6bbbcdba61f98a6d7a1c96f9d8afb4ab0842c7c443cb4c50819185a5aec8d5df",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "アーカイブを解凍します（例：__TRILIUM_PH_0__を使用）",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c2ebfadf40c2f6fe9d1c009a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "you can open the browser and open http://[your-server-hostname]:8080 and you should see Trilium initialization page",
      "sourceHash": "c2ebfadf40c2f6fe9d1c009a618e11bd6d8e98b3d4e51e650a3eab3112680339",
      "context": "Packaged version for Linux > Steps",
      "contextHash": "6bbbcdba61f98a6d7a1c96f9d8afb4ab0842c7c443cb4c50819185a5aec8d5df",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ブラウザを開いて http://[サーバーのホスト名]:8080 にアクセスすると、Triliumの初期化ページが表示されるはずです。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_31c2897da564f76502c70543_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "the console lists the addresses the server can be reached on, so you can also copy one from there",
      "sourceHash": "31c2897da564f76502c705432e5988104594e1d1dbd2d13b8c6036a85e6d60b4",
      "context": "Packaged version for Linux > Steps",
      "contextHash": "6bbbcdba61f98a6d7a1c96f9d8afb4ab0842c7c443cb4c50819185a5aec8d5df",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "コンソールにサーバーがアクセス可能なアドレスの一覧が表示されるため、そこからコピーすることもできます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
