    {
      "id": "u_c059852e6753f17e5945dacb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The problem with above steps is that once you close the SSH connection, the Trilium process is terminated. To avoid that, you have two options:",
      "sourceHash": "c059852e6753f17e5945dacbe4adef6a00c7217547fe7efc04d2ea737d2ae0ba",
      "context": "Packaged version for Linux > Steps",
      "contextHash": "6bbbcdba61f98a6d7a1c96f9d8afb4ab0842c7c443cb4c50819185a5aec8d5df",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "上記の手順の問題点は、SSH接続を閉じるとTriliumのプロセスが終了してしまうことです。それを回避するには、次の2つの方法があります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7becf5194cafcad24ba09fec_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Kill it (with e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__ + __TRILIUM_PH_2__C__TRILIUM_PH_3__) and run again like this: __TRILIUM_PH_4__. (nohup keeps the process running in the background, __TRILIUM_PH_5__ runs it in the background)",
      "sourceHash": "7becf5194cafcad24ba09fecd641a3b25f4d60dc457297631194d873480825d4",
      "context": "Packaged version for Linux > Steps",
      "contextHash": "6bbbcdba61f98a6d7a1c96f9d8afb4ab0842c7c443cb4c50819185a5aec8d5df",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "（例：__TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__ + __TRILIUM_PH_2__C__TRILIUM_PH_3__で）プロセスを終了し、次のように再度実行します：__TRILIUM_PH_4__。（nohupはプロセスをバックグラウンドで実行し続け、__TRILIUM_PH_5__はバックグラウンドで実行します）",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
